# Keep line endings stable in the working tree, not just in the repo.
#
# The test runners slice function bodies out of index.html by plain indexOf on
# source text (see CLAUDE.md). Some of those markers span a newline, so with
# core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout rewrote index.html to CRLF and the
# markers silently stopped matching — budgettest.cjs failed on a clean clone
# while the app itself was perfectly fine. Forcing eol=lf keeps the checked-out
# bytes identical to the committed bytes on every platform.
#
# The runners also normalise CRLF defensively when reading, so neither fix
# alone is load-bearing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
